OL,3,APaddy Power cuts 1,400 jobs and blames
OL,4,Abetting tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlutter boss Kevin Harrington said the
OL,7,Ftax hikes had "fundamentally changed"
OL,8,Fthe economic model of the UK betting
OL,9,Fand gaming industry, arguing it had
OL,10,Fhelped "fuel the unlicensed,
OL,11,Funregulated market".
